  "question": {
    "text": "A point <math><mtext>P</mtext></math>&nbsp;moves in a counter-clockwise direction on a circular path as shown in the figure. The movement of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext></math> is such that it sweeps out a length <math><mtext>s</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> where <math><mtext>s</mtext></math> is in metre and <math><mtext>t</mtext></math> is in seconds. The radius of the path is <math><mn>27&nbsp;</mn><mtext></mtext><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></math> The acceleration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext></math> when <math><mtext>t</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></math> is ____ <math><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3.6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0021_79ee29e1ce53.png\" style=\"width:1.97986in;height:1.90694in\" />"
  },
